; Cloudflare DNS import file for nakarinph.com
; Restores the apex domain to GitHub Pages. No SOA or NS records are included:
; Cloudflare manages those for a standard authoritative zone.
; Do not add an assets.nakarinph.com record here. Attach that hostname in
; Cloudflare R2 > bucket > Settings > Custom Domains after importing this file.

$ORIGIN nakarinph.com.
$TTL 3600

@  IN  A  185.199.108.153
@  IN  A  185.199.109.153
@  IN  A  185.199.110.153
@  IN  A  185.199.111.153
